gin  0 1cm from the inferior margin and 3 0cm from the deep margin  The remaining breast tissue is approximately 80  fatty and 20  fibrous  The fibrous tissue is dense white  lobular and cystic  This fibrous tissue abuts both the anterior and posterior margins  Representative sections are submitted as follows  K M  Biopsy cavity to both superior and inferior margins N  Biopsy cavity to superior margin O T  Posterior margin to include dense cystic fibrous tissue  Gross Description by  SHANNON SCHUTZ Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION   report_end  , Well_differentiated_(grade_I).
