ce measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm with a large REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm lymph node adjacent to a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm firm blue area  The specimen is bivalved and entirely frozen as FX  3  The specimen is entirely resubmitted in cassette C  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel hot and blue  are 2 blue lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  The larger node is bivalved and entirely frozen as FX  4  This node is entirely resubmitted in cassette D  The smaller node is frozen as FX  5  This node is entirely resubmitted in cassette E  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy  is a yellow lobulated REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm breast specimen  There is a short stitch marking the superior position and a long stitch marking the lateral position  The specimen is inked as follows  blue anterior  black posterior  The specimen was serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm stellate gritty mass which came to  0 2cm from the anterior margin  closest margin   This specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes F Q from medial to lateral  Please note the closest margin is in cassette M  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right mastectomy and axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm right mastectomy specimen with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE skin ellipse  The axillary tail measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm at one end of the specimen  The specimen is oriented by a long stitch marking lateral position and a short stitch marking the superior position  The external surface of the breast is inked in black and it is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm stellate nodule  nodule  1  with a central 0 1cm cavity  This cavity is