ns abundant amount of tan white rubbery fibrous tissue  No additional discrete mass or lesion is noted  The upper outer quadrant tissue is palpated for lymph nodes and no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire biopsy cavity to include posterior inked margin  upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  nodular breast parenchyma adjacent to the biopsy cavity  upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  nodular  fibrous breast parenchyma  central quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  outer quadrant  Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   on REMOVED_DATE Amendment  1 by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   Breast  Left   Simple Mastectomy  report_end  , Moderate_(grade_II).
