TE x 2 1cm biopsy cavity extends to within 2 5cm of the anterior margin in the superior lateral quadrant and underlies the linear scar noted on the skin ellipse  Radiating in all directions from the biopsy cavity is irregular  firm  white yellow scar tissue  The remaining breast parenchyma is yellow  fibrofatty and unremarkable  It is extensively searched for lymph nodes  and none is identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  Biopsy cavity to adjacent deep margin  C F  Biopsy cavity  G  Parenchyma away from biopsy cavity in superior lateral quadrant  H   Lymph node  Resident  JOHN BRANDA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Poor_(grade_III).
