ose tissue fragments  The larger pieces are serially sectioned and the specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes H J  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left nipple lesion  are 2 tan gray  granular indurated lesions measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  Both specimens are excised to a depth of  0 1cm  The resection margins are inked black  the specimens are serially sectioned and entirely submitted each in their own cassettes as K L  Gross Description by  JAMES BARRY Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  MJF                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE LEFT AXILLA  SENTINEL  106  EXCISION PART B  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST LEFT  SUPERFICIAL MARGIN  EXCISION PART D  SKIN  LEFT NIPPLE   EXCISION , Well_differentiated_(grade_I).
