ary lymph nodes  REMOVED_DATE of each Resident  Simon Bergman  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  Simon Bergman  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  AXILLARY CONTENTS    report_end  , Not_assessed.
