ma  medial Labeled  final shave margin  medial half of cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm unoriented fibrofatty soft tissue serially sectioned to reveal no nodules  Representative sections are submitted as M Q  Labeled  final shaved margin  lateral half of cavity  are multiple fragments of unoriented fibrofatty soft tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm in aggregate  serially sectioned to reveal no nodules  Representative sections are submitted as R V  Resident  SOHEIL DADRAS  MD  PHD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  MEDIAL HALF OF CAVITY  FINAL MARGIN PART C  LATERAL HALF OF CAVITY  FINAL MARGIN , Well_differentiated_(grade_I).
